{64}{[His brow furrows.]  No, and I'd do anything to see those old bones of his!  There are so many questions I could answer if I could only have a look at them!  When he died, how he died...I want to know if his skeletal structure is the same as common elves, or if his prolonged use of powerful magicks changed him somehow...so many questions!  And I've never been able to see them!}{[His brow furrows.]  No, and I'd do anything to see those old bones of his!  There are so many questions I could answer if I could only have a look at them!  When he died, how he died...I want to know if his skeletal structure is the same as common elves, or if his prolonged use of powerful magicks changed him somehow...so many questions!  And I've never been able to see them!}{}{}{}{ru 2075}
