{224}{I don't know.  Good god.  [Hadrian looks dully out the window.  He's obviously in shock.]  Why?  Why would they have buried him in the tomb of Nasrudin?  I...just...[he trails off...]}{I don't know.  Good god.  [Hadrian looks dully out the window.  He's obviously in shock.]  Why?  Why would they have buried him in the tomb of Nasrudin?  I...just...[he trails off...]}{}{}{}{gf2034 1, gf2040 1, ru 2101}
