{248}{[Anger flares in the eyes of Hadrian.]  The man truly was a Saint...a saint and a warrior.  And it seems that we Panarii have been neglecting our true duties...that will no longer be the case.  [He puts a hand to your shoulder.]  Thank you, my friend.  You've done this church, and the world, a great service...}{[Anger flares in the eyes of Hadrian.]  The man truly was a Saint...a saint and a warrior.  And it seems that we Panarii have been neglecting our true duties...that will no longer be the case.  [He puts a hand to your shoulder.]  Thank you, my friend.  You've done this church, and the world, a great service...}{}{}{}{}
